  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sinograin III</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sinograin III builds on the achievements and experiences of the Sinograin I and Sinograin II projects, aiming to contribute to the UN SDGs by widely implementing precision agriculture technologies and application of &#x201C;waste-to-value&#x201D; biochar products to achieve sustainable food production with minimized GHG emission, improve soil fertility and promote green growth/zero waste in modern agriculture in China. The project will be implemented by NIBIO.</narrative>
  </description>
